WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
The old town is quiet after midnight

2
00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.620
and a single lantern glows above the stone bridge

3
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.720
Narrow streets curve past wooden doors

4
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.980
and the cobblestones still hold the warmth of the day

5
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.760
A gray cat sits on a windowsill and watches the empty square with calm yellow eyes

6
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.320
Somewhere near the river

7
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.120
a bell in the clock tower rings once and the sound fades over the rooftops

8
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.320
The walker passes a closed bakery

9
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.000
where the smell of fresh bread drifts through a small open window

10
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.500
At the end of the lane

11
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.480
the moon rises over the hills and paints the chimneys silver

